### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Create a deposit
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-A0001",
  "amount": 500.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

### Create a transfer
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-A0001",
  "toAccount": "ACC-B0002",
  "amount": 100.50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### Create a withdrawal
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-A0001",
  "amount": 25.75,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "withdrawal"
}

### Validation error: bad account format
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "BAD-1",
  "toAccount": "ACC-B0002",
  "amount": -1,
  "currency": "ZZZ",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### List all transactions
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions

### Filter by accountId
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions?accountId=ACC-A0001

### Filter by type
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions?type=transfer

### Filter by date range
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions?from=2024-01-01&to=2030-12-31

### Combined filter
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions?accountId=ACC-A0001&type=transfer

### Get single transaction (replace :id)
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions/REPLACE_WITH_ID

### Account balance
GET http://localhost:3000/accounts/ACC-A0001/balance

### Account summary (Bonus A)
GET http://localhost:3000/accounts/ACC-A0001/summary

### Export transactions as CSV (Bonus C)
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions/export?format=csv